# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) before running `npm run dev`.
#
# Vite proxies /api/* — including WebSocket upgrades — to this target.
# It MUST match SERVER_PORT in backend/.env.
#
# Without this file Vite falls back to http://localhost:8080 (see
# vite.config.ts), while the backend listens on 8090 — every API call then
# fails with no obvious error. See docs/SETUP.md section 7.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8090
